	(gr_text "REPL-TEST  replicate/waiver test   rev X   2026-11-26   RR-EL-TEST2\n\nFABRICATION NOTES\n1. Material FR-4, Tg >= 150 C, 2 copper layers, finished thickness 1.60 mm +/-10 %.\n2. Outer copper 35 um (1 oz) finished.\n3. Min track / space 0.15 / 0.15 mm.  Min finished hole 0.30 mm.  Min annular ring 0.13 mm.\n4. Surface finish ENIG.  Solder mask both sides, vias tented.  Silkscreen both sides.\n5. Board outline per layer Edge.Cuts, tolerance +/-0.1 mm.  Outline 40.00 x 20.00 mm.\n6. Drill / pick-and-place origin = board origin, marked + on this drawing (Y axis up).\n7. Electrical test 100 % against the supplied Gerber netlist data.\n\nSTACKUP (top to bottom, mm)\n   F.Cu 0.035\n   core FR-4 1.510\n   B.Cu 0.035\n\nHOLE TABLE (finished sizes, mm)\n   dia      type   qty   use\n   0.3      PTH    2     \n   (2 of the plated holes are vias)"
